<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_IX__para_27> <https://schema.org/text> "The modification relating to subsection 24v(4) of the Consumer Protection Act 1999 in subsection 26(1) shall not affect any legal proceedings commenced to recover, or any judgment or award obtained for, the outstanding amount payable by the purchaser under the credit sale agreement during the period from 18 March 2020 until the date of publication of this Act. Modification to section 99"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
