<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_VII__para_20> <https://schema.org/text> "During the period of operation of this Part, a creditor or creditors shall not be entitled to present a bankruptcy petition against a debtor under section 2o or 5 of the Insolvency Act 1967, unless the debt owing by the debtor to the petitioning creditor, or if two or more creditors join in the petition the aggregate amount of debts owing to the several petitioning creditors, amounts to one hundred thousand ringgit. Saving"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
