<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_XIV__para_43__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "An order made under subsection (2) shall be laid before the Dewan Rakyat as soon as practicable after its publication in the Gazette. Modification to section 21"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
