<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_XIX__para_58__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_XIX__para_58> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
