<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_XIX__para_59__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister charged with the responsibility for any Act may, if the Minister is of the opinion that any statutory meeting is not possible to be convened, held or conducted in the manner provided in such Act during the period from 18 March 2020 to 9 June 2020 due to the measures prescribed, made or taken under the Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 to control or prevent the spread of COVID-19, by order published in the Gazette, provide for alternative arrangements for such meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
