<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_XI__para_34__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding any agreement entered into between the purchaser and the developer, where due to the measures prescribed, made or taken under the Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 to control or prevent the spread of COVID-19 the purchaser fails to pay any instalment for the period from 18 March 2020 to 31 August 2020, the developer shall not impose any late payment charges in respect of such unpaid instalment on the purchaser."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_XI__para_34__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_XI__para_34> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
