<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_X__para_29> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_X__para_29> <https://schema.org/text> "This Part is deemed to have come into operation on 18 March 2020 and shall continue to remain in operation until 31 December 2020. Modification to section 5"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
