<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_X__para_30> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of the recovery of rent due or payable to the landlord by a tenant of any premises, a warrant of distress issued under subsection 5(1) of the Distress Act 1951, shall not include the distrain for the arrears of rent for the period from 18 March 2020 to 31 August 2020. Saving"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_X__para_31> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_X> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_X__para_31> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "31" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_X__para_31> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@/~sched_1__part_X__para_31> <https://schema.org/text> "Any execution of the warrant of distress for the recovery of rent due or payable to the landlord by a tenant of any premises that has been issued before the date of publication of this Act shall be dealt with under the Distress Act 1951 as if the Distress Act 1951 had not been modified by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/6/eng@> .
